WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-US

00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:03.120
Hi there!

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:05.280
Today, I wanna tell you the story of a boy

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:07.680
and the mythical creatures who changed his world!

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:09.280
Now, this is a dance-along story

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:11.760
so try and&nbsp;follow along with the moves I do, okay?

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.040
Here we go...

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:15.520
I was walking down the street one day

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:18.480
when I noticed all of us were walking the same way

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:21.440
Stiff like a robot, and eyes straight ahead

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:23.774
No color on our clothes,
no purple, green or red

00:00:23.774 --> 00:00:29.541
But then I caught my eye
on some sparkles on the ground

00:00:29.541 --> 00:00:32.480
So I ran, fast as I can

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:36.129
Followed the trail to a place
where the music was playing....

00:00:36.129 --> 00:00:38.898
Jump up and down,
and poke your horn

00:00:38.898 --> 00:00:41.600
Jump up and down
like a rainbow disco unicorn!

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:44.558
Jump up and down,
and poke your horn

00:00:44.558 --> 00:00:47.338
Jump up and down
like a rainbow disco unicorn!

00:00:53.335 --> 00:00:56.080
After I had seen the color and fun

00:00:56.080 --> 00:00:58.880
I knew I had to share with everyone

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:02.000
So I took to the town
with a skip in my step

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.480
Showed them my dance,
with energy and pep

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:09.840
But to my utter surprise,
nobody seemed to care at all

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:12.880
I wanted to quit,
thought that was it

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:16.338
When suddenly I heard that sweet music playing...

00:01:16.338 --> 00:01:19.397
